<scopecontent encodinganalog="520$a">
<head>Scope and Content
</head>
<p>This manuscript by W. Glenn Tussey, 1989, documents the Barksdale Family Cemetery, located at the junction of Route 743 and 606 in Albemarle County, Virginia. It includes physical descriptions of the cemetery and short biographies of Barksdale family members buried there.
</p>
</scopecontent>

